        "movement": "Press through both feet and extend the hips for two seconds while keeping the knees at the same angle.",
        "endpoint": "Hold for one second at your maximum controlled hip-extension angle.",
        "returnPhase": "Lower the pelvis to the floor over two seconds while keeping both feet planted.",
        "controlledJoints": "Create the repetition at the hips; do not straighten the knees or arch the lower back.",
